# .easignore overrides .gitignore for build archiving.
# The root .gitignore excludes android/ (and google-services.json), but a
# prebuild/build needs google-services.json, so this keeps the android/ SOURCE
# present while still dropping heavy build artifacts + node_modules.
# Local build only — nothing is uploaded to a remote builder.

# Heavy / regenerated
**/node_modules/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/web-build/
**/coverage/
**/.gradle/
**/android/app/build/
**/ios/build/
**/ios/Pods/

# Noise
**/*.log
**/*.orig.*
**/.DS_Store
bookmyworkers-mobile

# Local secrets / signing — never archive
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/release.keystore
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/*.mobileprovision
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/google-service-account.json
